## Core Findings Summary

1. **FloatingNav Tab Container Missing `role="tablist"` (Critical — WCAG 1.3.1, 4.1.2)**
   - **Expected:** Every `<div role="tab">` must be nested inside an ancestor `<div role="tablist">`.
   - **Actual:** FloatingNav renders 4 tabs (`Home`, `Quran`, `Library`, `Tools`) without a `role="tablist"` parent. Axe flags `aria-required-parent` as **CRITICAL** across all 52 crawled routes.
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json), [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/flaky-reruns.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/flaky-reruns.json).

2. **FloatingNav Missing `role="navigation"` and Active State Attributes (Serious — WCAG 1.3.1, 4.1.2)**
   - **Expected:** Navigation container has landmark `role="navigation"` and the active tab announces its state (`aria-selected="true"` or `aria-current="page"`).
   - **Actual:** Zero navigation landmarks found on FloatingNav (`hasNavigationLandmark: false`). Active tab omits both `aria-selected` and `aria-current`.
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json).

3. **Sub-4.5:1 Text Color Contrast on 25 Dark and 26 Light Routes (Serious — WCAG 1.4.3)**
   - **Expected:** Text and images of text must meet at least 4.5:1 contrast against their background (3:1 for large text).
   - **Actual:** Muted subtitle labels, Arabic surah metadata pills, and timestamps measure between 2.1:1 and 3.8:1 contrast across 25 dark routes and 26 light routes.
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json), [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-light.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-light.json).

4. **340+ Interactive Touch Targets Smaller Than 44x44px (Serious — WCAG 2.5.5, 2.5.8)**
   - **Expected:** Interactive controls have an effective touch target size of at least 44x44 CSS pixels.
   - **Actual:** Widespread sub-44px targets:
     - Top bar `Notifications` and `Open settings` icon buttons: `32x32px`
     - Modal close buttons: `32x32px`
     - Step/filter pills (Tasbih presets, Hajj/Umrah steps): `32px` to `35px` height
     - Home retry button: `75x38px`
     - Form search inputs: `42px` height
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/modal-LocationSetupModal.png`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/modal-LocationSetupModal.png), [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json).

5. **Missing `aria-checked` on Radio Buttons & Prohibited Attributes in Settings (Critical — WCAG 4.1.2)**
   - **Expected:** Radio buttons provide `aria-checked="true|false"`. Generic divs without interactive roles do not have `aria-label`.
   - **Actual:** In `App::Modal` (Settings), 34 theme/accent radio buttons have `role="radio"` but omit `aria-checked` (Axe `aria-required-attr` Critical). Backdrop dismissal element `<div aria-label="Close settings">` has no interactive role (Axe `aria-prohibited-attr` Serious).
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/modals-audit.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/modals-audit.json), [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/modal-AppModal-Settings.png`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/modal-AppModal-Settings.png).

6. **Search Inputs and Textareas Lack Accessible Names Across 15 Routes (Serious — WCAG 1.3.1, 4.1.2)**
   - **Expected:** All inputs and textareas have an accessible label (`<label>`, `aria-label`, or `aria-labelledby`).
   - **Actual:** 25 inputs/textareas rely exclusively on `placeholder` attributes without an accessible label (e.g. `quran/home`, `quran/notes`, `quran/hifz`, `tools/zakat`).
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json).

7. **Multiple H1 Section Headings Without Hierarchical Nesting (Moderate — WCAG 1.3.1, 2.4.6)**
   - **Expected:** Page has one root `<h1>` followed by logical `<h2>`/`<h3>` subheadings.
   - **Actual:** All 52 routes render multiple `<h1>` section tags without hierarchical nesting (e.g. "KNOWLEDGE & COLLECTIONS" and "GUIDES & EDUCATION" on Home are both `<h1>`).
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/routes-393-dark.json).

8. **Keyboard Tab Navigation Skips Primary Feed Cards (Moderate — WCAG 2.1.1)**
   - **Expected:** All interactive feed items are reachable via standard keyboard Tab traversal.
   - **Actual:** Cards rendered with `TouchableOpacity` lack `tabindex="0"` on web. Tab traversal jumps straight from Retry to FloatingNav tabs, skipping the primary cards.
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/keyboard-focus-summary.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/keyboard-focus-summary.json).

9. **Zero Compiled `prefers-reduced-motion` CSS Media Rules (Moderate — WCAG 2.3.3)**
   - **Expected:** Stylesheets compile `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` rules to suppress non-essential animations.
   - **Actual:** Browser `matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches` is true, but 0 CSS media rules for reduced motion exist in bundled stylesheets.
   - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/reduced-motion-audit.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/reduced-motion-audit.json).

10. **130% Text Scale Header Clipping (Minor — WCAG 1.4.4)**
    - **Expected:** Content scales to 130% without clipping or horizontal overflow.
    - **Actual:** No page horizontal overflow occurs (`scrollWidth === clientWidth`), but compact header subtitles and pill badges clip text under 130% zoom in `library`, `quran/home`, and `quran/reader`.
    - **Evidence:** [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/text-scale-audit.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/text-scale-audit.json), [`reports/audit/evidence/S6/textscale-library-130pct.png`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S6/textscale-library-130pct.png).

